	(text "The CAN interface is implemented using a TCAN1042\n transceiver with proper 3.3 V I/O, ESD protection,\n selectable 120 Ω termination via jumper, and a standard CANH/CANL/GND connector \nfor reliable differential communication. \nConnect the Jetson to CAN only through a USB-to-CAN adapter, \nwiring its CANH to J3-1, CANL to J3-2, and GND to J3-3 on this board."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 685.8 130.81 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "2a13de90-6bb1-4234-9eb5-36ab6a335ed4")
	)
	(text "5 VDC input from TPS56A37RPAR buck converter output, \nVOUT (TPS259474 OUT): Protected 5 VDC rail \nfeeding Jetson Nano Dev Kit 5 V input (J41 pins 2 & 4)\nPG ---> Teensy 4.1 GPIO input"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 147.32 229.87 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "2d72b3fd-368f-42a3-94c8-d86e7af77caf")
	)
	(text "6 Limit sensors terminals"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 709.93 379.73 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "48eacf42-3e7c-4e1b-b5b7-def4698be14a")
	)
	(text "Keep 100 kΩ pull-up from EN to +5V_LOGIC (post-ferrite, same node as IN),\n ensuring always-on operation while allowing future EN control if needed."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 386.08 210.82 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "620208dd-c400-4b6f-a413-352ed1056489")
	)
	(text "For the BigTreeTech TMC2209 with a 7-pin logic connector, \nconnect VM to +24V motor supply*, both GND pins to system ground,\n VDD to 3.3V_LOGIC, STEP to the Teensy STEPx pin, DIR to the Teensy DIRx pin,\n and EN to GLOBAL_EN_N (active-low); leave MS1, MS2, PDN/UART, CLK, \nand DIAG unconnected unless used later, and wire the motor only to A1/A2 for coil A and B1/B2 for coil B.\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 697.23 513.08 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "666de502-9bf5-4eb1-a461-4b800b7db7dd")
	)
	(text "E-Stop(A22NZ-MNM-NGA1) with Deadman stop withRC filter. \nGLOBAL_ENABLE is hardware-enforced via an active-LOW MOSFET gate;\n drivers are disabled unless E-STOP (NC), DEADMAN (NO), \nand MCU MOTION_ALLOW are all asserted, ensuring fail-safe shutdown independent \nof firmware state."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 76.2 546.1 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "b65c0468-286f-43b6-a337-3563933b635a")
	)
	(text "RS-485 half-duplex interface with optional termination jumper,\n failsafe biasing, surge protection, and MCU-controlled direction."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 695.96 262.89 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "cce2b8be-0cc3-4ca2-81be-f86f4aada1b2")
	)
	(text "For Notes:"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 351.79 262.89 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 3 3)
			)
		)
		(uuid "f5af023a-0e7d-4019-85de-e3f9d94f0daf")
	)
